<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    /* ── 5분 AI 뉴스 스타일 에디토리얼 뉴스레터 ── */
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
      background: #f7f6f3;
      color: #1a1917;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* 헤더 */
    .masthead {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      padding-bottom: 24px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1917;
    }
    .masthead-title {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #1a1917;
    }
    .masthead-sub {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #6b6960;
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .masthead-meta {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #9e9b8f;
      margin-top: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    }

    /* 리드 */
    .lead {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #3a3937;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      background: #fff;
      border-left: 3px solid #c4600a;
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    }

    /* 구분선 */
    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #e0ddd7;
      margin: 32px 0;
    }

    /* 아티클 */
    .article {
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e0ddd7;
    }
    .article-header {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .article-number {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #c4600a;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .article-title {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.35;
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }
    .article-title a {
      color: #1a1917;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .article-title a:hover {
      color: #c4600a;
    }
    .article-domain {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #9e9b8f;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .article-summary {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #3a3937;
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    }
    .article-tags {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .article-tag {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #c4600a;
    }

    /* 푸터 */
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e0ddd7;
    }
    .footer-brand {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1a1917;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .footer-copy {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #9e9b8f;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #c4600a;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* 반응형 */
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      body { padding: 20px 16px; }
      .article { padding: 20px; }
      .masthead-title { font-size: 24px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">

    <!-- 마스티드 -->
    <div class="masthead">
      <h1 class="masthead-title">주간 링크 큐레이션</h1>
      <p class="masthead-sub">이번 주에 저장하고 분석한 콘텐츠를 정리했습니다</p>
      <p class="masthead-meta"><%= @digest[:date] %> · <%= @digest[:favorites_count] %>개 저장 · URLFavorites</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 리드 -->
    <div class="lead">
      이번 주에는 <strong><%= @digest[:favorites_count] %>개</strong>의 콘텐츠를 아카이브했습니다.
      아래에서 각 콘텐츠의 AI 분석 요약과 핵심 키워드를 확인하세요.
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <!-- 아티클 목록 -->
    <% @digest[:favorites].each_with_index do |fav, i| %>
      <div class="article">
        <div class="article-header">
          <span class="article-number"><%= (i + 1).to_s.rjust(2, '0') %></span>
          <h3 class="article-title">
            <a href="<%= ERB::Util.h(fav[:url]) %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><%= fav[:title] %></a>
          </h3>
          <% host = URI.parse(fav[:url]).host rescue nil %>
          <% if host %>
            <span class="article-domain"><%= host.sub(/^www\./, '') %></span>
          <% end %>
        </div>
        <% if fav[:summary].present? %>
          <p class="article-summary"><%= fav[:summary] %></p>
        <% end %>
        <% if fav[:tags].any? %>
          <div class="article-tags">
            <% fav[:tags].first(5).each do |tag| %>
              <span class="article-tag">#<%= tag %></span>
            <% end %>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    <% end %>

    <!-- 푸터 -->
    <div class="footer">
      <p class="footer-brand">URLFavorites 2.0</p>
      <p class="footer-copy">AI 분석을 통해 저장한 콘텐츠의 핵심을 자동으로 추출합니다</p>
      <p><a href="<%= ERB::Util.h(favorites_url) %>">모든 저장된 링크 보기 →</a></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
